cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, cite them as below. The underlying statistics are
  produced by National Treasury, the Auditor-General, the IEC and Statistics South
  Africa; cite them too where you can."
title: "SA open data: preserved copies of South African local-government datasets"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Evertse
    given-names: Tim
    affiliation: University of Cape Town
repository-code: "https://github.com/realtimshady16/sa-open-data"
url: "https://github.com/realtimshady16/sa-open-data"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Preserved copies of four South African public datasets, captured 2026-11-09 to
  2026-11-10: 292 Municipal Money municipal financial profiles (National Treasury),
  257x8 municipal audit outcomes (Auditor-General, MFMA 2024-25), council composition
  after the 2016 and 2021 elections (IEC), and free basic services per municipality
  (Stats SA P9115). Two of the sources are year-stamped or unstable and are not
  archived elsewhere, which is why this copy exists. Includes provenance, a sha256
  manifest, and unmodified fetchers.
keywords:
  - South Africa
  - local government
  - municipal finance
  - audit outcomes
  - elections
  - open data
  - data preservation
